---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What is included in the free SEO audit?',
    a: 'The free audit delivers a health check covering indexation status, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals scores, Google Business Profile review, and three prioritised quick wins for immediate implementation. The report is delivered via email within 48 hours.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How does the free audit compare to the paid audit?',
    a: 'The free audit is an automated snapshot covering five key areas. The paid audit (£497) is a comprehensive, manually conducted analysis covering technical SEO, content quality, backlink profile, local SEO, and competitor benchmarking, delivered as a detailed PDF report with a 30-minute walkthrough call.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is website access required for the free audit?',
    a: 'No. The free audit runs using publicly available data from the live website. CMS access, Google Search Console, and Google Analytics are not required for the free version.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is there any obligation after receiving the free audit?',
    a: 'None. The free audit carries no obligation and no strings attached. If the client wishes to discuss findings or explore a full audit, our team is available, but there is no unsolicited follow-up.',
  },
];

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Free SEO Audit Birmingham',
  description: 'Free SEO health check for Birmingham businesses covering indexation, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, Google Business Profile, and quick wins.',
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Colmore SEO',
    url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk',
    sameAs: [],
    areaServed: {
      '@type': 'City',
      name: 'Birmingham',
      containedInPlace: { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'West Midlands' },
    },
  },
  serviceType: 'Free SEO Audit',
  areaServed: {
    '@type': 'City',
    name: 'Birmingham',
    containedInPlace: { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'West Midlands' },
  },
  offers: {
    '@type': 'Offer',
    price: '0',
    priceCurrency: 'GBP',
    availability: 'https://schema.org/InStock',
    description: 'Free automated SEO health check for Birmingham businesses',
  },
};

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: f.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a },
  })),
};
---

<Base
  title="Free SEO Audit Birmingham | Colmore SEO"
  description="Free SEO audit for Birmingham businesses. We check indexation, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, and Google Business Profile with 3 prioritised quick wins."
  schema={[serviceSchema, faqSchema]}
  ogType="website"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>Free SEO Audit Birmingham</h1>

    <p>Our free SEO audit is a rapid health check built for Birmingham businesses that need to assess their current search visibility without financial commitment. It covers the five most critical ranking factors and delivers three specific actions for immediate implementation.</p>

    <div class="quick-answer">
      <strong>Quick Answer:</strong> Submit a website below and receive a free SEO health check within 48 hours. The report covers indexation status, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, Google Business Profile, and three prioritised quick wins. No cost. No obligation. No unsolicited follow-up.
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>What the Free Audit Covers</h2>

      <p>The free audit focuses on five areas that have the greatest measurable impact on whether a Birmingham business appears in search results.</p>

      <h3>Indexation Status</h3>
      <p>We check how many pages Google has indexed versus how many exist on the site. If Google is indexing only a fraction of the content, there is a fundamental visibility problem that must be addressed before any other optimisation work begins.</p>

      <h3>Mobile Usability</h3>
      <p>The majority of local searches in Birmingham originate from mobile devices. A site must render correctly on smartphones. We test mobile performance and flag usability issues that cost rankings and conversions.</p>

      <h3>Core Web Vitals</h3>
      <p>We measure page speed, interactivity, and visual stability against Google's Core Web Vitals thresholds. These metrics are a confirmed ranking factor and directly affect user experience. Slow-loading sites lose visitors, particularly in competitive Birmingham markets where searchers have immediate alternatives.</p>

      <h3>Google Business Profile Review</h3>
      <p>For Birmingham businesses targeting local customers, the Google Business Profile carries weight equal to the website itself. We check profile completeness, category accuracy, review volume, and common configuration errors that prevent appearance in the local 3-pack.</p>

      <h3>Three Prioritised Quick Wins</h3>
      <p>Every free audit includes three specific, actionable recommendations for immediate implementation. These are not generic suggestions. They are precise changes with clear instructions, selected because they deliver the highest impact for the least effort on the specific site audited.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What the Free Audit Does Not Cover</h2>

      <p>The free audit is an automated snapshot, not a comprehensive analysis. It does not include:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Manual content quality review</li>
        <li>Backlink profile analysis</li>
        <li>Competitor benchmarking</li>
        <li>Detailed technical crawl of every page</li>
        <li>Keyword cannibalisation checks</li>
        <li>Walkthrough call with our team</li>
      </ul>

      <p>For a thorough, manually reviewed audit with a detailed action plan, our <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">paid SEO audit</a> at £497 covers all of the above. The free audit serves as a useful first step to determine whether a deeper investigation is warranted.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who This Audit Is For</h2>

      <p>The free audit is designed for Birmingham organisations in any of the following situations:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>No prior SEO audit has been conducted and a baseline assessment is needed</li>
        <li>Investment in SEO is under consideration but evidence of specific issues is required first</li>
        <li>A new website has recently launched and a quick sanity check is needed</li>
        <li>A Digbeth startup, Jewellery Quarter retailer, or Colmore professional firm wants a baseline reading before committing to ongoing SEO</li>
        <li>A comparison of site health against Birmingham competitors is needed</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Request Your Free Audit</h2>

      <p>Complete the form below. Our team will deliver the free SEO health check within 48 hours to the email address provided.</p>

      <form action="#" method="POST" class="not-prose bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mt-6 mb-8">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Full Name</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="name"
              name="name"
              required
              placeholder="Jane Smith"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Email Address</label>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="email"
              name="email"
              required
              placeholder="jane@example.co.uk"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="website" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Website URL</label>
            <input
              type="url"
              id="website"
              name="website"
              required
              placeholder="https://www.yourbusiness.co.uk"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="business_type" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Business Type</label>
            <select
              id="business_type"
              name="business_type"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow appearance-none"
            >
              <option value="" disabled selected>Select your industry</option>
              <option value="professional-services">Professional Services (Legal, Accounting, Consulting)</option>
              <option value="retail-ecommerce">Retail and E-Commerce</option>
              <option value="hospitality">Hospitality (Restaurants, Hotels, Bars)</option>
              <option value="healthcare">Healthcare and Medical</option>
              <option value="construction-trades">Construction and Trades</option>
              <option value="manufacturing">Manufacturing and Engineering</option>
              <option value="education-training">Education and Training</option>
              <option value="technology">Technology and SaaS</option>
              <option value="property">Property and Estate Agents</option>
              <option value="events-entertainment">Events and Entertainment</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="w-full bg-brand text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors text-base cursor-pointer shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            Request Free SEO Audit
          </button>

          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted text-center mt-3">No spam. No obligation. Report delivered within 48 hours to hello@seo-birmingham.uk.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 style="color: white; margin-top: 0;">Need a Comprehensive Analysis?</h2>
      <p>The free audit provides a starting point. For a full, manually reviewed audit with a detailed action plan and walkthrough call, explore our paid SEO audit.</p>
      <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">Request a Proposal</a>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{faq.q}</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{faq.a}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Related Pages</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">SEO Birmingham</a> — full services overview</li>
        <li><a href="/services/">All SEO Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">SEO Audit Birmingham</a> — comprehensive analysis</li>
        <li><a href="/seo-pricing-birmingham/">SEO Pricing</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
